<title>UK: Kansai Electric sets 1.0 bln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kansai Electric sets 1.0 bln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KANSAI ELECTRIC POWER CO</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DFL   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    30.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.207   PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.532    SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 DENOMS (K) 500-1000  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.75 PCT DSL DUE FEB.2007</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
